# Codex CLI leftover worktrees
.codex-*/

# Temp working directories created by source-intake-readiness test runs.
# The suite makes one per run with a random suffix and removes it on exit, so
# a `git add -A` between those two moments commits 200+ scratch files. That
# happened in 34d40d5 and is what this line prevents.
.source-intake-readiness-*/
